Jockeys can also be manually summoned using commands:
Chicken Jockey
In Java Edition: {{cmd|/summon minecraft:chicken ~ ~ ~ {IsChickenJockey:1b,Passengers:[{id:"minecraft:zombie",IsBaby:1b}]} }}
In Bedrock Edition, it requires two commands:
Variants of zombies or ridden mobs can be summoned by replacing chicken and zombie respectively.
Camel Husk Jockey
In Java Edition: {{cmd|/summon minecraft:camel_husk ~ ~ ~ {Passengers:[{id:"minecraft:husk",equipment:{mainhand:{id:"minecraft:iron_spear",count:1 }}} ,{id:"minecraft:parched",equipment:{mainhand:{id:"minecraft:bow",count:1 }}}]} }}
In Bedrock Edition:
Cave Spider Jockey
In Java Edition: {{cmd|/summon minecraft:cave_spider ~ ~ ~ {Passengers:[{id:"minecraft:skeleton",HandItems:[{id:"minecraft:bow",count:1}]}] } }}
In Bedrock Edition:
Hoglin Jockey
In Java Edition: {{cmd|/summon minecraft:hoglin ~ ~ ~ {Age:-12000,Passengers:[{id:"minecraft:piglin",IsBaby:1}] } }}
In Bedrock Edition, it requires two commands:
Ravager Jockey
In Java Edition:
{{cmd|/summon minecraft:ravager ~ ~ ~ {Passengers:[{id:minecraft:pillager,HandItems:[{id:crossbow,Count:1b}]}] } }}
This command summons a ravager with a pillager rider.
{{cmd|/summon minecraft:ravager ~ ~ ~ {Passengers:[{id:minecraft:vindicator,HandItems:[{id:iron_axe,Count:2b}]}] } }}
This command summons a ravager with a vindicator rider.
