Since the was moved into the and component groups, instead of being in the base components list, these broken piglins are not in any family, causing them to have the following issues:
They cannot be put in boats or minecarts.
The Smite enchantment does not deal more damage to them, due to them not being part of the family.
They are not targeted by iron golems and snow golems, due to them not being part of the family.
They are targeted by withers, and are able to damage it, due to them not being part of the family.
Armadillos do not roll up when near them, due to them not being part of the family.
Piglins do not avoid them. They also do not avoid normal unbroken baby zombified piglins, as they are in the family, rather than the family.
They are affected by the Poison and Regeneration effects, due to them not being part of the family, but Instant Health and Instant Damage are still reversed for them.
